{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/a1fb10c574f8ce18e38f76f6068b6834.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/a1fb10c574f8ce18e38f76f6068b6834.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/a1fb10c574f8ce18e38f76f6068b6834.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the religion of Unio, the people of Era live their lives bound to one of the Seven Deadly Sins. Those who resist their urges are promised eternity in the sacred land of Hellden. But for those who succumb, a fate worse than death awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Hellden is a classically inspired action JRPG set in a gorgeous hand-painted 3D world, featuring illustrations by Takeshi Oga (<i>Gravity Rush</i>) and a soundtrack by Hitoshi Sakimoto (<i>Final Fantasy XII, Final Fantasy Tactics, Valkyria Chronicles</i>). Follow eight highly customisable characters on a journey through Era and beyond, and master a phased battle system that balances real-time and turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/68715853eab6c5073ed09e8117857e6d.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/68715853eab6c5073ed09e8117857e6d.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/68715853eab6c5073ed09e8117857e6d.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story of Sin and Self-Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birth of twins is a terrible omen. The binding ritual fails, leaving Cyphel born without sin and Leht bound to all seven. The babies are hidden away in the Unio Temple to be raised as Arkhons, defenders of the faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, Leht escapes, driven to overcome his unique burden. Cyphel must leave the safety of the temple to find him, and is thrust into a world of monsters, rebels, and celestial conspiracy. Lost Hellden tells a rich story of self-discovery, family, and fate, fully voiced in Japanese and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/830dcb4b897120b4742e5e9260086ef6.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/830dcb4b897120b4742e5e9260086ef6.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/830dcb4b897120b4742e5e9260086ef6.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Form of Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique phased battle system combines the thrill of real-time action with the tactical possibilities of turn-based combat. Leverage timing, positioning, elemental attributes and whole-team commands as you attack and defend against enemies monstrous and divine. Utilise powerful Transcendence abilities to turn the tide of battle. Fine-tune your party with a multi-layered job system, ability tree, and a wide range of equipment options to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/dca61b069ab34ea1216b255a9c285914.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/dca61b069ab34ea1216b255a9c285914.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/dca61b069ab34ea1216b255a9c285914.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Painted World to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the box art of a classic JRPG thanks to a unique \u2018Deep 2D\u2019 art style, with contributions from Takeshi Oga (<i>Gravity Rush</i>). Lost Hellden\u2019s aesthetics are underpinned by a gorgeous soundtrack by Hitoshi Sakimoto (<i>Final Fantasy XII, Final Fantasy Tactics, Valkyria Chronicles</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/b5af4d000732f3671ae62633decb1b4c.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/b5af4d000732f3671ae62633decb1b4c.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/b5af4d000732f3671ae62633decb1b4c.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets lurk behind every corner: explore the world for hidden items, collectables, and enemies. Take advantage of changes in weather and special abilities to meet NPCs and new areas. Help those you meet on your journey, or while away the day mastering Era\u2019s most popular board game, Hexaken.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2355020?t=1764259846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/aef19f1ca34635b70c0bc4a7aced187b201b1d74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764259846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/37e9a3a7ad06f9fb7657e22cb7462231172eaa63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764259846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/37e9a3a7ad06f9fb7657e22cb7462231172eaa63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764259846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/021c004ed96ccbeb94c27b72fad818d3.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/021c004ed96ccbeb94c27b72fad818d3.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/021c004ed96ccbeb94c27b72fad818d3.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight playable characters, each with unique abilities and skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A phased battle system that combines real-time and turn-based combat, with elemental abilities, summons, timing bonuses, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 jobs, and a wide range of equipment items to fine-tune your characters and team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully voiced story in Japanese and English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather systems, which affect battle, NPCs, and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items and collectables in every region</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexaken, a tactical card game popular all over Era</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast world rendered with \u2018Deep 2D\u2019 technology, with illustrations by Takeshi Oga</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stunning soundtrack by Hitoshi Sakimoto</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/a1fb10c574f8ce18e38f76f6068b6834.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/a1fb10c574f8ce18e38f76f6068b6834.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/a1fb10c574f8ce18e38f76f6068b6834.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the religion of Unio, the people of Era live their lives bound to one of the Seven Deadly Sins. Those who resist their urges are promised eternity in the sacred land of Hellden. But for those who succumb, a fate worse than death awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Hellden is a classically inspired action JRPG set in a gorgeous hand-painted 3D world, featuring illustrations by Takeshi Oga (<i>Gravity Rush</i>) and a soundtrack by Hitoshi Sakimoto (<i>Final Fantasy XII, Final Fantasy Tactics, Valkyria Chronicles</i>). Follow eight highly customisable characters on a journey through Era and beyond, and master a phased battle system that balances real-time and turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/68715853eab6c5073ed09e8117857e6d.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/68715853eab6c5073ed09e8117857e6d.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/68715853eab6c5073ed09e8117857e6d.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story of Sin and Self-Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birth of twins is a terrible omen. The binding ritual fails, leaving Cyphel born without sin and Leht bound to all seven. The babies are hidden away in the Unio Temple to be raised as Arkhons, defenders of the faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, Leht escapes, driven to overcome his unique burden. Cyphel must leave the safety of the temple to find him, and is thrust into a world of monsters, rebels, and celestial conspiracy. Lost Hellden tells a rich story of self-discovery, family, and fate, fully voiced in Japanese and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/830dcb4b897120b4742e5e9260086ef6.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/830dcb4b897120b4742e5e9260086ef6.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/830dcb4b897120b4742e5e9260086ef6.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Form of Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique phased battle system combines the thrill of real-time action with the tactical possibilities of turn-based combat. Leverage timing, positioning, elemental attributes and whole-team commands as you attack and defend against enemies monstrous and divine. Utilise powerful Transcendence abilities to turn the tide of battle. Fine-tune your party with a multi-layered job system, ability tree, and a wide range of equipment options to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/dca61b069ab34ea1216b255a9c285914.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/dca61b069ab34ea1216b255a9c285914.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/dca61b069ab34ea1216b255a9c285914.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hand-Painted World to Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the box art of a classic JRPG thanks to a unique \u2018Deep 2D\u2019 art style, with contributions from Takeshi Oga (<i>Gravity Rush</i>). Lost Hellden\u2019s aesthetics are underpinned by a gorgeous soundtrack by Hitoshi Sakimoto (<i>Final Fantasy XII, Final Fantasy Tactics, Valkyria Chronicles</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/b5af4d000732f3671ae62633decb1b4c.poster.avif?t=1764259846\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/b5af4d000732f3671ae62633decb1b4c.webm?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/extras/b5af4d000732f3671ae62633decb1b4c.mp4?t=1764259846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets lurk behind every corner: explore the world for hidden items, collectables, and enemies. Take advantage of changes in weather and special abilities to meet NPCs and new areas. Help those you meet on your journey, or while away the day mastering Era\u2019s most popular board game, Hexaken.</p>","developers":["Artisan Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355020/c76f2928e10f625de97cc626e789a1ba523b6433/header.jpg?t=1764259846","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Lost Hellden \u00a9 2025 Artisan Studios, Inc.. All rights reserved. Developed by Artisan Studios, Inc., and exclusively licensed to Kwalee Ltd. Kwalee is a trademark of Kwalee Ltd. All other trademarks and logos are the property of their respective owners.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLost Hellden uses Unity. \"Unity\", Unity logos, and other Unity trademarks are trademarks or registered trademarks of Unity Technologies or its affiliates in the U.S. and elsewhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnity, Copyright \u00a9 2025 Unity Technologies. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2355020/1177206306/32fb8ab557735e7961d34ae34962c209bb906fbc/1755003020/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755717792","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2355020/1177206306/32fb8ab5